          "filename": "Jerome, Arizona, wider panorama.jpg",
          "caption": "Panorama of Jerome in the U.S. state of Arizona, as seen from Jerome Cemetery. Originally 28 vertical images in 2 stacked rows.  This  panoramic image was created with Autostitch (stitched images may differ from reality). The hill marked with a \"J\" is Cleopatra Hill. The site of the United Verde open-pit copper mine, which ceased operations in 1953, is to the right, on the edge of town. Below it, also to the right, is the site of the UVX mine and the mansion of its owner, James Douglas, Jr. The mansion and grounds have become Jerome State Historic Park.",
          "alt": "Panorama of Jerome in the U.S. state of Arizona, as seen from Jerome Cemetery. Originally 28 vertical images in 2 stacked rows.  This  panoramic image was created with Autostitch (stitched images may differ from reality). The hill marked with a \"J\" is Cleopatra Hill. The site of the United Verde open-pit copper mine, which ceased operations in 1953, is to the right, on the edge of town. Below it, also to the right, is the site of the UVX mine and the mansion of its owner, James Douglas, Jr. The mansion and grounds have become Jerome State Historic Park.",
